    "edit_note": "Placeholder \u89b3\u89a7\u8eca waterfront park, 110 x 160 plot (the sea -Y, the gulf -X, the entrance at +X +Y): a 100 m wheel on a 60 m hub (two white rims, 32 gondolas, A-frame legs) in the water corner, a boarding hall under its low point, a promenade along both waterfront edges. The game assumes: the wheel's plane is X-Z (its circle faces +-Y, the open sea), the wheel does not turn yet (a later runtime job: rotate a separate rim + gondola object), and the collider is the mesh itself."
